  "details": "After adding a certain number of people, eventually it gets tricky to remember who is what, between random invites, members of a clan you're in (like Loli Army), people you knew elsewhere, and people you made a deeper connection with in-game.\n\nOn steam I deal with this through the friend tagging system, and would like to suggest an adaptation of this for VRChat.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/2gvPw",
